   "en": "In 2022, a new law was enacted for the protection of children - the Juvenile Welfare Law. With severe punishments for minors, this law greatly reduced the rate of juvenile crime...not! \n\nAs juvenile crimes get more twisted and bizarre, only the government's designated Juvenile Detectives can step in and solve the case. One day, Juvenile Detective Kokorono Koro is called to the scene of a strange and bloody murder..."
